<main id="main" class="heat-brief" data-brief-root>
  <header class="heat-brief__header">
    <a href="/heat-map/compare/" data-role="compare-link">← Back to Compare</a>
    <span>Delta Climate Research</span>
    <button type="button" data-action="print">Print brief</button>
  </header>
  <article class="heat-brief__paper">
    <p class="heat-brief__eyebrow">Urban Heat Explorer / Screening record</p>
    <h1>Paired scenario brief</h1>
    <p class="heat-brief__lede">A controlled, modelled comparison of the same intervention package across two equal study windows. This is not a ward ranking or an investment-priority recommendation.</p>
    <div class="heat-brief__status" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-role="status">Preparing a client-side reproduction of this record.</div>
    <section class="heat-brief__section">
      <h2>Scenario</h2>
      <dl class="heat-brief__scenario"><div><dt>Tree corridors</dt><dd data-value="trees">—</dd></div><div><dt>Cool roofs</dt><dd data-value="roofs">—</dd></div><div><dt>Green façades</dt><dd data-value="facades">—</dd></div><div><dt>Phase</dt><dd data-value="phase">—</dd></div><div><dt>Contract</dt><dd>paired-coverage-v1</dd></div></dl>
    </section>
    <section class="heat-brief__section">
      <h2>Paired evidence</h2>
      <div class="heat-brief__table" role="table"><div class="heat-brief__row heat-brief__row--head" role="row"><span>Measure</span><strong data-value="a-name">A</strong><strong data-value="b-name">B</strong></div><div class="heat-brief__row" role="row"><span>Baseline mean</span><strong data-value="a-baseline">—</strong><strong data-value="b-baseline">—</strong></div><div class="heat-brief__row" role="row"><span>Scenario mean</span><strong data-value="a-scenario">—</strong><strong data-value="b-scenario">—</strong></div><div class="heat-brief__row" role="row"><span>Cooling from baseline</span><strong data-value="a-cooling">—</strong><strong data-value="b-cooling">—</strong></div><div class="heat-brief__row" role="row"><span>Indicative capital</span><strong data-value="a-cost">—</strong><strong data-value="b-cost">—</strong></div></div>
    </section>
    <section class="heat-brief__section heat-brief__evidence"><h2>Integrity and limits</h2><dl><div><dt>Forcing</dt><dd data-value="forcing">Awaiting record</dd></div><div><dt>Grid</dt><dd>192 × 192, hm-grid-192-v1</dd></div><div><dt>Data</dt><dd>ward-geometry-v1</dd></div><div><dt>Publication</dt><dd>Screening-grade, modelled heat field</dd></div></dl><p>The current release uses an explicitly labelled interim fallback reference to verify the architecture. It is not an observed regional heat-day record. Before publication, replace it with a cited reference location, date, source, and actual 13:00/22:00 conditions.</p></section>
  </article>
</main>

<style>
  .heat-brief{--ink:oklch(18% .018 205);--muted:oklch(45% .025 205);--paper:oklch(97% .01 90);--surface:oklch(93% .015 90);--line:oklch(68% .035 90);--accent:oklch(48% .1 202);min-height:100vh;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:'Mona Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;padding:1.5rem}.heat-brief *{box-sizing:border-box}.heat-brief__header,.heat-brief__paper{max-width:58rem;margin:0 auto}.heat-brief__header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:1rem;font:600 .68rem 'Noplato Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}.heat-brief__header a,.heat-brief__header button{color:var(--accent);background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer}.heat-brief__paper{padding:clamp(2.5rem,8vw,6rem) 0}.heat-brief__eyebrow{font: .65rem 'Noplato Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--accent)}.heat-brief h1{font-size:clamp(2.8rem,8vw,5.4rem);letter-spacing:-.065em;line-height:.9;margin:.65rem 0 1rem}.heat-brief__lede{max-width:62ch;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted)}.heat-brief__status{margin:2rem 0;padding:.8rem 1rem;background:var(--surface);border-left:3px solid var(--accent);font:.66rem 'Noplato Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase}.heat-brief__section{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:1.5rem 0}.heat-brief h2{font-size:1.15rem;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0 0 1rem}.heat-brief__scenario{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1rem;margin:0}.heat-brief__scenario div,.heat-brief__evidence dl div{display:grid;gap:.2rem}.heat-brief dt{font:.57rem 'Noplato Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}.heat-brief dd{margin:0;font-weight:600}.heat-brief__table{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.heat-brief__row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr repeat(2,1fr);gap:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:.75rem 0;font-size:.85rem}.heat-brief__row--head{font:.58rem 'Noplato Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}.heat-brief__evidence{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(12rem,.65fr) 1fr;gap:1rem}.heat-brief__evidence h2{grid-row:1/3}.heat-brief__evidence dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:1rem;margin:0}.heat-brief__evidence p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;font-size:.86rem}@media(max-width:600px){.heat-brief__header span{display:none}.heat-brief__scenario{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.heat-brief__row{grid-template-columns:1.2fr repeat(2,1fr);gap:.5rem}.heat-brief__evidence{display:block}.heat-brief__evidence dl{margin-bottom:1rem}}@media print{.heat-brief{padding:0;background:#fff}.heat-brief__header button{display:none}.heat-brief__paper{padding:2rem 0}.heat-brief__status{background:#f3f5f2}.heat-brief__section{break-inside:avoid}}
</style>
